grotto (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial unreleased Preview package, GUI and daemon together.
  * Install canonical desktop/activation/metainfo/icons and opt-in login template.
  * Include native bunker/headless network examples; do not enable remote traffic.
  * Require GTK 4.14, Adwaita 1.5, GLib 2.80 and camera decode/capture dependencies.
  * Recommend the optional Nostr Shell extension. Keep sandbox formats experimental.
  * Packaging corrections fold into initial 0.1.0; manual promotion gates remain open.

